{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Sqrt","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Notation","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen_lt_right_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen_lt_right_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":187,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L187-L196","doc":"The symmetric statement: `λ₋ < b` too, so the coupled ground level lies strictly\nbelow **both** uncoupled levels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen_lt_left_of_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen_lt_left_of_ne","kind":"theorem","line":172,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L172-L185","doc":"**Strict interlacing.** With any nonzero coupling `t`, the coupled ground level is\n**strictly below** the uncoupled level `a` — tensor mixing binds the deuteron *harder*.\nSince the uncoupled `³S₁` is already 27.3 % over-bound, the coupling moves it the wrong\nway. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen_le_left","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen_le_left","kind":"theorem","line":160,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L160-L170","doc":"`λ₋ ≤ a`: the coupled ground level never sits above the uncoupled `³S₁` level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen_is_eigenvalue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen_is_eigenvalue","kind":"theorem","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L152-L158","doc":"`λ₋` is a root of the characteristic polynomial `(a − λ)(b − λ) − t² = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.lowerEigen","kind":"def","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L148-L150","doc":"The lower eigenvalue of the real symmetric block `[[a, t], [t, b]]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.tensorOp_annihilates_singlet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.tensorOp_annihilates_singlet","kind":"theorem","line":134,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L134-L140","doc":"**On the unit sphere the tensor operator annihilates the singlet.** The `pp` / `nn`\nchannels — pure spin singlets by Pauli in an S-wave — are untouched by any tensor\ncoupling, for every direction `n̂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.tensorOp_mulVec_singlet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.tensorOp_mulVec_singlet","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L123-L132","doc":"**The tensor operator acts as the scalar `3(1 − |n|²)` on the singlet.** The singlet is\nan eigenvector for every direction — there is no off-diagonal element out of `S = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.nDotProd_mulVec_singlet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.nDotProd_mulVec_singlet","kind":"theorem","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L113-L121","doc":"**`(σ₁·n)(σ₂·n)` acts as `−|n|²` on the singlet, for every `n`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.sigmaDot_mulVec_singlet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.sigmaDot_mulVec_singlet","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L106-L111","doc":"**`σ₁·σ₂` acts as `−3` on the singlet.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.tensorOp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.tensorOp","kind":"def","line":102,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L102-L104","doc":"The tensor operator `S₁₂(n) = 3 (σ₁·n)(σ₂·n) − σ₁·σ₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.nDot2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.nDot2","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L99-L100","doc":"`σ₂·n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.nDot1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.nDot1","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L97-L98","doc":"`σ₁·n` for a direction `n = (n₁, n₂, n₃)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.sigmaDot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.sigmaDot","kind":"def","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L94-L95","doc":"`σ₁·σ₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.singlet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.singlet","kind":"def","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L91-L92","doc":"The spin singlet `|↑↓⟩ − |↓↑⟩` (unnormalised). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s2z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s2z","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L88-L89","doc":"`1 ⊗ σ_z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s2y","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s2y","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L85-L87","doc":"`1 ⊗ σ_y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s2x","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s2x","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L83-L84","doc":"`1 ⊗ σ_x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s1z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s1z","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L81-L82","doc":"`σ_z ⊗ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s1y","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s1y","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L78-L80","doc":"`σ_y ⊗ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s1x","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.TensorCouplingSinglet.s1x","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/TensorCouplingCannotUnbindSinglet.lean#L76-L77","doc":"Basis order `|↑↑⟩, |↑↓⟩, |↓↑⟩, |↓↓⟩` (particle 1 first). `σ_x ⊗ 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}